{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_9_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，天王使南季來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"南，氏姓也。季，字也。聘，問也。聘諸侯，非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"二、三月，癸酉，大雨，震電。庚辰，大雨雪。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"震，雷也。電，霆也。志疏數也，八日之間，再有大變，陰陽錯行，故謹而日之也。雨月，志正也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"三、俠卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"俠者所俠也。弗大夫者，隱不爵大夫也。隱之不爵大夫何也？曰，不成為君也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"四、夏，城郎。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"無事焉，何以書？不遺時也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"六、冬，公會齊侯於防。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_9_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_9","textTraditional":"會者，外為主焉爾。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}